{
  "bodyHash": "yMphAK0v1GQ=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/IriDark/Valoria/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/valoria/textures/gui/title/valoria_logo.png\" alt=\"valoria_logo.png\"></p><h3>系統需求</h3><p>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tridot\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/-Tridot (Curseforge)-d48526?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=000000&amp;labelColor=FFFFFF\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ftridot\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/-Tridot (Modrinth)-349a46?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=000000&amp;labelColor=FFFFFF\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/-Curios (Curseforge)-d48526?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=000000&amp;labelColor=FFFFFF\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcurios\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/-Curios (Modrinth)-349a46?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=000000&amp;labelColor=FFFFFF\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/-GeckoLib (Curseforge)-d48526?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=000000&amp;labelColor=FFFFFF\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fgeckolib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/-GeckoLib (Modrinth)-349a46?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=000000&amp;labelColor=FFFFFF\"></a>\n</p><hr><p><em>迷失在破碎的世界？知識是對抗腐化的最佳武器。請查閱官方維基以獲得指南、背景故事和生存策略。</em></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252firidark.gitbook.io%252fvaloria-wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/IriDark/Valoria/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/valoria/textures/banners/wiki.png\" alt=\"wiki.png\"></a></p><p><em>加入我們的社群，分享你的創作、提供意見回饋，並搶先一窺陰影中潛伏的內容。</em></p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/wWdXpwuPmK\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/IriDark/Valoria/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/valoria/textures/banners/discord.png\" alt=\"discord.png\"></a></p><p><em>為了幫助我們投入更多時間於此專案，並資助音樂和音效設計等新資產，請考慮支持我們。</em></p><p><a href=\"https://patreon.com/IriDark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/IriDark/Valoria/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/valoria/textures/banners/patreon.png\" alt=\"patreon.png\"></a></p><h3>我們的 Patreon 贊助者</h3><p>Amanda, Lion1… 非常感謝你們 &lt;3</p><hr><h1>✦ 關於此模組 ✦</h1><p><strong>一場遠古浩劫——元素崩壞——撕裂了現實。從灰燼中，一個新世界誕生：一個充滿黑暗神話與恐怖廢墟的領域。</strong></p><p><em>Valoria</em> 將 Minecraft 轉變為史詩級黑暗奇幻 RPG 體驗。穿越被怪物肆虐的荒涼景觀，拼湊出一個隕落世界的破碎歷史，並發現希望能否從餘燼中重燃。</p><h3>特色</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>⚔️ 史詩遭遇戰：</strong> 使用龐大的武器庫面對新的生物和可怕的 Boss。包含大量新建築方塊和物品，皆保持原版友善的視覺風格。</li>\n<li><strong>🏰 未知之地：</strong> 探索複雜的建築、奇異的生態域，以及充滿秘密和危險的完全新維度。</li>\n<li><strong>📖 深厚背景故事：</strong> 揭開一個根植於神話、獎勵探索的豐富黑暗奇幻故事線。</li>\n<li><strong>🎵 沉浸式音效：</strong> 體驗由 <a href=\"https://youtube.com/playlist?list=OLAK5uy_kTIzlCKrHm_RyFxoZPmnKZNccdCT6XL-c&amp;si=0-No5jkq0tsd3neC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">DuUaader</a> 創作的令人難忘的原創配樂。</li>\n<li><strong>🔧 高度可配置：</strong> 模組包開發者擁有完全控制權。可移動或隱藏 HUD 元素（<code>valoria-client.toml</code>）、自訂 Boss 屬性（<code>valoria-common.toml</code>），或切換核心機制，如虛無、食物腐敗和法典進度（<code>valoria-server.toml</code>）。</li>\n</ul><hr><h3>🏛️ 發掘被遺忘的廢墟</h3><p>Valoria 的地景散落著獨特、手工打造的建築，等待被發現。從崩塌的遺跡到隱藏著特定實體的巨型收容設施——請謹慎前行，因為致命的陷阱和遠古守護者仍在守護著其中的一切。</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/IriDark/Valoria/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/valoria/textures/banners/structure.png\" alt=\"structure.png\">\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/IriDark/Valoria/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/valoria/textures/banners/fortress_angle.png\" alt=\"fortress_angle.png\">\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/IriDark/Valoria/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/valoria/textures/banners/forge.png\" alt=\"forge.png\"></p><h3>🌿 在扭曲的植物中求生</h3><p>崩壞並未摧毀世界，而是使其突變。穿越生機勃勃、異星般奇特的生態域，大自然在此奮力收復廢墟。古老的植物已讓位給能夠自行發光的奇特新生命形式。在這永恆的暮色中，發光植物可能是你唯一的希望燈塔。</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/IriDark/Valoria/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/valoria/textures/banners/shadeforest.png\" alt=\"shadeforest.png\">\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/IriDark/Valoria/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/valoria/textures/banners/river.png\" alt=\"river.png\">\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/IriDark/Valoria/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/valoria/textures/banners/lush.png\" alt=\"lush.png\">\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/IriDark/Valoria/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/valoria/textures/banners/ecotone.png\" alt=\"ecotone.png\"></p><h3>💀 在灰燼荒原中搜刮</h3><p>穿越整個生態系統的敞開墳墓。荒原被幽靈般的森林糾纏，塵土飛揚，是一道被無情的悲傷之風緩慢侵蝕的傷痕累累的地景。</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/IriDark/Valoria/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/valoria/textures/banners/dread_wood.png\" alt=\"dread_wood.png\"></p><h3>🐺 面對可怕的畸變體</h3><p>舊世界的動物群並未倖免於難。腐化迫使生物適應或滅亡，倖存者因此變成極具領地意識的獵人。牠們潛伏於這個破碎世界的陰影中，而對牠們來說——你不過是猎物。</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/IriDark/Valoria/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/valoria/textures/banners/scorpion.png\" alt=\"scorpion.png\">\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/IriDark/Valoria/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/valoria/textures/banners/corrupted.png\" alt=\"corrupted.png\"></p><h3>🩸 解開天界瘟疫之謎</h3><p>天空本身已破碎。一顆惡意的紅色行星高懸夜空，其凝視如同對大地的毒藥。這個天體滋養著一種蔓延的「血源腐化」——一種持續吞噬世界的瘟疫。循著它的軌跡，你將會發現被稱為「巨獸」的巨大感染遺骸。</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/IriDark/Valoria/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/valoria/textures/banners/monstrosity.png\" alt=\"monstrosity.png\">\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/IriDark/Valoria/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/valoria/textures/banners/remains.png\" alt=\"remains.png\">\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/IriDark/Valoria/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/valoria/textures/banners/skull.png\" alt=\"skull.png\"></p><hr><hr><h3>🛠️ 整合與相容性</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>內建支援：</strong> JADE, JER, JEI, KubeJS, JEED, Enchantment Descriptions, Better Combat, Tetra, Detailed Enchantments, Catalogue, Obscure Tooltips。</li>\n<li><strong>自動生成：</strong> JERM。</li>\n<li><strong>Every Compat：</strong> 自 1.0r 起支援。</li>\n<li><strong>Epic Fight：</strong> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/valoria-ef-compat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">下載擴充包 (CurseForge)</a></li>\n<li><strong>Dynamic Trees（社群擴充）：</strong> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-trees-valoria\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">下載擴充包 (CurseForge)</a></li>\n</ul><p><em>歡迎在我們的 <a href=\"https://github.com/IriDark/Valoria-Suggestions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> 上建議模組相容性。</em></p><hr><h3>🌐 支援的語言</h3><ul>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/IriDark/Valoria/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/valoria/textures/banners/flag_en_us.png\" alt=\"flag_en_us.png\"> <strong>英文</strong></li>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/IriDark/Valoria/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/valoria/textures/banners/flag_ua.png\" alt=\"flag_ua.png\"> <strong>烏克蘭文</strong> <em>(進行中)</em> - 由 IriDark, Foxplane 提供</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/IriDark/Valoria/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/valoria/textures/banners/flag_pl.png\" alt=\"flag_pl.png\"> <strong>波蘭文</strong> <em>(進行中)</em> - 由 𝙆𝘼𝙈𝙀𝙃𝙇𝙇𝙄𝙉𝙆 提供</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/IriDark/Valoria/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/valoria/textures/banners/flag_ru.png\" alt=\"flag_ru.png\"> <strong>俄文</strong> - 由 Ruthenium, TerraPrime, Kerdo, refiq_ 提供</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/IriDark/Valoria/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/valoria/textures/banners/flag_fr.png\" alt=\"flag_fr.png\"> <strong>法文</strong> <em>(進行中)</em> - 由 𝙆𝘼𝙈𝙀𝙃𝙇𝙇𝙄𝙉𝙆 提供</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/IriDark/Valoria/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/valoria/textures/banners/flag_cn.png\" alt=\"flag_cn.png\"> <strong>簡體中文</strong> - 由 蓝龙奈特萨玛 (Azurmardraco BlueDragon) 提供</li>\n</ul><p><em>找不到你的語言或想要協助維護翻譯？歡迎在 <a href=\"https://github.com/IriDark/Valoria/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 貢獻和提交 PR</a>。</em></p><hr><h3>📜 致謝與貢獻者</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>AstemirDev</strong> - 程式碼</li>\n<li><strong>Auriny</strong> - 程式碼、測試</li>\n<li><strong>Skoow</strong> - 程式碼</li>\n<li><strong>Sunday</strong> - 模型</li>\n<li><strong>Kerdo</strong> - 動畫、音效、點子、貢獻</li>\n<li><strong>LowTransient-34</strong> - 音樂</li>\n</ul><p><strong>翻譯者：</strong> Ruthenium, TerraPrime, 𝙆𝘼𝙈𝙀𝙃𝙇𝙇𝙄𝙉𝙆, 蓝龙奈特萨玛 (Azurmardraco BlueDragon)</p><p><strong>特別感謝與資產：</strong></p><ul>\n<li><em>Pandafolk_Ravio_Li, Rofoo, KoteykaTheCat, GraFik, Wosaj, Rainach, .sweetberries, Feimos, Avacuoss</em></li>\n<li><strong>Calamity Mod Team</strong> - 提供出色的音效設計靈感和音效資產。</li>\n<li><strong>Tyro.net</strong> - 法典中的太空背景 (<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftools.wwwtyro.net%252fspace-3d%252findex.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">來源</a>)</li>\n</ul>",
